{
  "name": "Email Management - Send Reply with Correct Headers",
  "id": "jaw9967-send-reply-headers",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9967)\n- Webhook `POST /send-reply` with **Outreach Webhook Header Auth**; outbound send uses **Outreach Gmail OAuth** (HTTP Request).\n- `threadId` is a Gmail API thread id; **In-Reply-To** / **References** use RFC Message-Ids from the last message in that thread (`threads.get` format=full).\n- Reply **To** = original **From**; subject prefixed with `Re:` when missing.\n- Dedupe on `threadId` per run (`Remove Duplicate Thread Id`). Audit: `email_reply_send_audits` (thread_id only). Errors: `workflow_error_logs` + Gmail to `$env.ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL` (no message body logged).",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "9967aa11-bb22-4433-cc44-dd55ee667788",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
